('8cc36f9d-c05b-502b-97df-fe46f18ab94a'::uuid, 'Physiology (Paper 2)', 'Renal and Body Fluids', 'Osmolar clearance (Cosm) is calculated as:', '["Uosm x Posm/V","Uosm + Posm/V","Posm x V/Uosm","V x Posm/Uosm","Uosm x V/Posm"]'::jsonb, 'Uosm x V/Posm', 'Cosm = (Urine osmolality x Volume) / Plasma osmolality.'),
