('c63e0994-9bb4-5eb3-bfd3-219fb5f2a5e1'::uuid, 'Physiology (Paper 2)', 'Renal and Body Fluids', 'The outer medullary osmotic gradient is primarily due to:', '["Urea","KCl","HCO3-","Glucose","NaCl"]'::jsonb, 'NaCl', 'Active NaCl transport by TAL creates the gradient in the outer medulla.'),
