('b21977aa-1278-5035-8fc2-9eb609c91ab4'::uuid, 'Physiology (Paper 2)', 'Special Senses', 'The trapezoid body is a decussation of fibers in the:', '["Visual pathway","Vestibular pathway","Somatosensory pathway","Motor pathway","Auditory pathway"]'::jsonb, 'Auditory pathway', 'The trapezoid body is where auditory fibers cross in the pons.'),
