('6d5a5475-4da7-58c5-9e14-0c314923b49e'::uuid, 'Physiology (Paper 2)', 'Reproduction', 'The acrosome contains:', '["Nutrients mediated physiological mechanism","Hydrolytic enzymes (hyaluronidase, acrosin) for penetrating the zona pellucida","Sperm DNA mediated physiological mechanism","Mitochondria mediated physiological mechanism","Centrioles mediated physiological mechanism"]'::jsonb, 'Hydrolytic enzymes (hyaluronidase, acrosin) for penetrating the zona pellucida', 'Acrosomal enzymes digest a path through the zona pellucida for sperm entry.'),
