('a9e8f3e5-b910-54a3-be71-90f287d3233c'::uuid, 'Physiology (Paper 2)', 'Reproduction', 'Amiiotic fluid cushions the fetus and:', '["Nourishes the fetus mediated physiological mechanism","Allows fetal movement, maintains temperature, and prevents amniotic adhesions","Provides oxygen mediated physiological mechanism","Removes waste mediated physiological mechanism","Protects from infection mediated physiological mechanism"]'::jsonb, 'Allows fetal movement, maintains temperature, and prevents amniotic adhesions', 'Amiiotic fluid is essential for normal fetal development.'),
('17f2b441-7cf6-56d8-acc7-8697aa24bd98'::uuid, 'Physiology (Paper 2)', 'Reproduction', 'With respect to management, Syngamy refers to:', '["Implantation mediated physiological mechanism","Cleavage division mediated physiological mechanism","Fusion of male and female pronuclei to form the zygote nucleus","Cortical reaction mediated physiological mechanism","Sperm-egg fusion mediated physiological mechanism"]'::jsonb, 'Fusion of male and female pronuclei to form the zygote nucleus', 'Syngamy completes the fertilization process.'),
