('925d1c5c-90e3-5767-92e6-058258c97051'::uuid, 'Physiology (Paper 2)', 'Reproduction', 'Ectopic pregnancy may present with:', '["Back pain mediated physiological mechanism mediated physiological mechanism","Painless bleeding mediated physiological mechanism mediated physiological mechanism","Asymptomatic mediated physiological mechanism mediated physiological mechanism","Sharp abdominal pain, vaginal bleeding, adnexal tenderness, and positive hCG without intrauterine","Fever only mediated physiological mechanism mediated physiological mechanism"]'::jsonb, 'Sharp abdominal pain, vaginal bleeding, adnexal tenderness, and positive hCG without intrauterine', 'Ectopic pregnancy can cause rupture and life-threatening hemorrhage.'),
