('4bd502e1-2078-5940-85ab-6ed5a3019d79'::uuid, 'Physiology (Paper 2)', 'Reproduction', 'The placental barrier consists of:', '["Only syncytiotrophoblast mediated physiological mechanism","Syncytiotrophoblast, cytotrophoblast, and fetal capillary endothelium","Chorion mediated physiological mechanism","Only endothelium mediated physiological mechanism","Amnion mediated physiological mechanism"]'::jsonb, 'Syncytiotrophoblast, cytotrophoblast, and fetal capillary endothelium', 'The placental membrane separates maternal and fetal blood.'),
('5493b973-bd07-59ee-b101-c58233e21c27'::uuid, 'Physiology (Paper 2)', 'Reproduction', 'The umbilical vein carries:', '["Oxygenated blood from the placenta to the fetus","Nutrient-depleted blood mediated physiological mechanism","Mixed blood mediated physiological mechanism","Deoxygenated blood mediated physiological mechanism","Blood to the placenta mediated physiological mechanism"]'::jsonb, 'Oxygenated blood from the placenta to the fetus', 'The umbilical vein carries freshly oxygenated and nutrient-rich blood from the placenta to the fetus.'),
('1e77031b-3a88-522d-81d1-6748ba49d7b4'::uuid, 'Physiology (Paper 2)', 'Reproduction', 'The umbilical arteries carry:', '["Deoxygenated blood from the fetus to the placenta","Mixed blood mediated physiological mechanism","Oxygenated blood mediated physiological mechanism","Nutrient-rich blood mediated physiological mechanism","Blood to the fetal brain mediated physiological mechanism"]'::jsonb, 'Deoxygenated blood from the fetus to the placenta', 'The two umbilical arteries carry deoxygenated blood and waste products from the fetus to the placenta.'),
('c4a20129-0b52-5fba-859e-c6a1a8dddc33'::uuid, 'Physiology (Paper 2)', 'Reproduction', 'The fetal zone of the adrenal cortex:', '["Produces DHEA-S for placental estrogen synthesis","Produces aldosterone mediated physiological mechanism","Produces cortisol mediated physiological mechanism","Produces androgens only mediated physiological mechanism","Atrophies before birth mediated physiological mechanism"]'::jsonb, 'Produces DHEA-S for placental estrogen synthesis', 'The fetal zone is large and secretes DHEA-S, which the placenta uses for estrogen production.'),
('f2a1993c-218d-5240-bf0c-0e903e749e10'::uuid, 'Physiology (Paper 2)', 'Reproduction', 'Fetal hemoglobin (HbF) has:', '["Higher CO2 affinity mediated physiological mechanism","No O2 binding mediated physiological mechanism","Lower O2 affinity mediated physiological mechanism","Higher O2 affinity (binds O2 more tightly) than adult Hb","Same O2 affinity mediated physiological mechanism"]'::jsonb, 'Higher O2 affinity (binds O2 more tightly) than adult Hb', 'HbF (alpha2gamma2) has a lower P50 (~20 mm Hg) than HbA (~27 mm Hg), facilitating O2 transfer from mother.'),
